
. * nwalaam tutorial 1: a first autologistic actor attribute model on the karate c
> lub
. * Requires the core nwcommands and the package nwalaam. The data (Zachary 1977) 
> are loaded from the nwcommands website.
. set linesize 80

. 
. nwalaam version
nwalaam version 1.2.0, 19nov2026
  native plugin           : /Users/tgrund/FILES_NEW/SOFTWARE/nwalaam/lib/plugins
> /macos/alaam_sim_macos.plugin (ships with the package)
  reference               : ALAAMEE (Stivala, Wang and Lomi) and MPNet
  license                 : GNU GPL-3

. 
. * --- the network and the outcome: which of the 34 members joined the officer'
> s side of the split? ---
. nwwebuse zachary, nwclear

. tabulate group

      group |      Freq.     Percent        Cum.
------------+-----------------------------------
          1 |         16       47.06       47.06
          2 |         18       52.94      100.00
------------+-----------------------------------
      Total |         34      100.00

. generate byte faction = (group == 2)

. nwsummarize zachary_bin
--------------------------------------------------
   Network name:  zachary_bin
